{"author":{"id":"609bf866d4a5d716c19faf5d617b3bf3de478230d29602d72aad5aa90a80466f"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1790609494,"nonce":"eSeeUf1pHNKxJEIfEO7gSZSJcf0=","title":"AIR: a Ref\u003ci32\u003e to the loop variable reads the next iteration's value","message":"Passing the `for` loop variable (or an expression of it) as an optional `Int` argument,\nwhich Haxe compiles as `hl.Ref\u003ci32\u003e`, gives the callee a value one iteration ahead.\n`ASH_AIR=0` fixes `--mode interp` but not `--mode jit`. It is independent of tiering: it\nfails at every threshold, in interp and jit, and before and after the hybrid Ref\u003cf32\u003e\nboundary fix.\n\n```haxe\nclass O {\n\tpublic var i:Int;\n\tpublic function new(i:Int = 0) { this.i = i; }\n}\nclass M5 {\n\tstatic function main() {\n\t\tvar bad = 0;\n\t\tvar lastI = -1, lastK = -1;\n\t\tfor (k in 0...100) {\n\t\t\tvar o = new O(k);\n\t\t\tif (o.i != k) { bad++; lastI = o.i; lastK = k; }\n\t\t}\n\t\tSys.println('bad=$bad lastI=$lastI lastK=$lastK');\n\t}\n}\n```\n\n    haxe -main M5 -hl m5.hl\n    ash --mode interp m5.hl              # bad=100 lastI=100 lastK=99\n    ash --mode jit m5.hl                 # bad=100 lastI=100 lastK=99\n    ASH_AIR=0 ash --mode interp m5.hl    # bad=0\n    ASH_AIR=0 ash --mode jit m5.hl       # bad=100 lastI=100 lastK=99\n\nBinding the argument to a fresh local first (`var v = k * 3 + 1; new O(v)`) gives bad=0,\nwhich points at the ref'd register being coalesced with the loop counter, which is\nalready incremented when the callee reads it. Not yet confirmed in the AIR passes.\n\nOther shapes seen while writing the Ref\u003cf32\u003e regression fixture: `new O(k \u0026 0xFFFF)` also\nfails, and in a larger function the result flips between right and wrong when unrelated\nstatements are added or removed (wrapping an `if` body in a block was enough), so a\nreduction should compare with `ASH_AIR=0` rather than trust a single variant.\n\n`crates/ash_cli/tests/ref_args.rs` runs with `ASH_AIR=0` to keep this out of that test;\ndrop it once this is fixed.","files":null}]}